3365       *----------------- Data on Physical Fitness -----------------*
3366       | These measurements were made on men involved in a physical |
3367       | fitness course at N.C. State University. |
3368       | Only selected variables of |
3369       | Oxygen (oxygen intake, ml per kg body weight per minute), |
3370       | Runtime (time to run 1.5 miles in minutes), and |
3371       | RunPulse (heart rate while running) are used. |
3372       | Certain values were changed to missing for the analysis. |
3373       *------------------------------------------------------------*;
3374       data Fitness1;
3375       input Oxygen RunTime RunPulse @@;
3376       datalines;

NOTE: SAS went to a new line when INPUT statement reached past the end of a line.
NOTE: The data set WORK.FITNESS1 has 31 observations and 3 variables.

3393       ;
3394       proc mi data=Fitness1 seed=3237851 noprint out=outmi;
3395       var Oxygen RunTime RunPulse;
3396       run;

WARNING: The default number of imputations has been changed from 5 to 25.
NOTE: The EM algorithm (MLE) converges in 12 iterations.
NOTE: The EM algorithm (posterior mode) converges in 7 iterations.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTMI has 775 observations and 4 variables.

3397       proc reg data=outmi outest=outreg covout noprint;
3398       model Oxygen= RunTime RunPulse;
3399       by _Imputation_;
3400       run;

NOTE: Interactivity disabled with BY processing.
